# Keep the Docker build context lean and force a clean in-image install/build
# (Story 5-2). Host node_modules (pnpm symlinks) and prior build output must NOT
# leak into the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
.github
_bmad-output
.claude
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
